Singapore National Badminton Player <strong>Terry Yeo<\/strong><\/a><br \/>\nWe managed to catch Singapore&#8217;s national team player Terry Yeo for an interview. He plays for Singapore&#8217;s Mixed and.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"\/\">Back from <strong>Professional Badminton Players Interview<\/strong> to <strong>Home Page<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff3300;\"><b style=\"display: none;\">Please Like me on Facebook. Thanks!<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"fb-like\" data-href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/HowToPlayBadminton\" data-send=\"true\" data-width=\"100%\" data-show-faces=\"false\">\n<div id=\"COMMENTING\" class=\"fb-comment remove-comment\">\n<div class=\"retnvbx\"><\/div>\n<h3><span class=\"teelmeww\">Tell me what you think!<\/span><\/h3>\n<p>What do you think about what you just read? Leave me a comment below.<\/p>\n<div class=\"fb-comments\" data-href=\"http:\/\/www.how-to-play-badminton.com\/professional-badminton-interview.html\" data-num-posts=\"15\" data-width=\"100%\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Interviews with professional badminton players from India, Malaysia, Thailand, Singapore and USA.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[18,55],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-287","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-interviews-with-professional-badminton-players","category-parent"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v25.6 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Professional Badminton Players Interview: Learn from their success<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Interviews with professional badminton players from India, Malaysia, Thailand, Singapore and USA.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follo